  "data_boundary": "Author-created sector-month Gram sufficient statistics, numerical target labels, normalized ETF total-return indices, public factor series, and Treasury yields. No call text, issuer identifiers, firm embeddings, portfolio holdings, or capitalization observations are included. Upstream text/identity/embedding regeneration requires separately obtained licensed inputs. These informative similarity matrices are not claimed to guarantee irreversibility.",
